*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% PPD for a generic 203dpi USB thermal label printer that speaks TSPL.
*% The stock vendor driver ships an x86_64-only binary filter, so this PPD
*% routes rasters through our own rastertotspl instead.
*%
*% Generated by scripts/make_ppd.py -- edit that, not this file.
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "labeltsp.ppd"
*Manufacturer: "LabelPrinter"
*Product: "(Label Printer)"
*ModelName: "Thermal Label Printer TSPL"
*ShortNickName: "Thermal Label Printer"
*NickName: "Thermal Label Printer TSPL"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 550"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 705"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 1.2
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsModelNumber: 20
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertotspl"
*% Tells CUPS what raster iOS may send us, so the queue advertises itself as
*% AirPrint-capable: 8-bit greyscale at 203dpi, no duplex.
*cupsUrfSupported: "V1.4,W8,RS203,DM1,CP1"

*OpenGroup: General/General
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: 4x6.Fullbleed
*PageSize 4x6.Fullbleed/4.00x6.00" (shipping label): "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x8.Fullbleed/4.00x8.00": "<</PageSize[288 576]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x4.Fullbleed/4.00x4.00": "<</PageSize[288 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 3x5.Fullbleed/3.00x5.00": "<</PageSize[216 360]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 2.25x4.Fullbleed/2.25x4.00": "<</PageSize[162 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 2x4.Fullbleed/2.00x4.00": "<</PageSize[144 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 100x150mm.Fullbleed/100mm x 150mm: "<</PageSize[283 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: 4x6.Fullbleed
*PageRegion 4x6.Fullbleed/4.00x6.00" (shipping label): "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 4x8.Fullbleed/4.00x8.00": "<</PageSize[288 576]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 4x4.Fullbleed/4.00x4.00": "<</PageSize[288 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 3x5.Fullbleed/3.00x5.00": "<</PageSize[216 360]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 2.25x4.Fullbleed/2.25x4.00": "<</PageSize[162 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 2x4.Fullbleed/2.00x4.00": "<</PageSize[144 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 100x150mm.Fullbleed/100mm x 150mm: "<</PageSize[283 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: 4x6.Fullbleed
*ImageableArea 4x6.Fullbleed/4.00x6.00" (shipping label): "0 0 288 432"
*ImageableArea 4x8.Fullbleed/4.00x8.00": "0 0 288 576"
*ImageableArea 4x4.Fullbleed/4.00x4.00": "0 0 288 288"
*ImageableArea 3x5.Fullbleed/3.00x5.00": "0 0 216 360"
*ImageableArea 2.25x4.Fullbleed/2.25x4.00": "0 0 162 288"
*ImageableArea 2x4.Fullbleed/2.00x4.00": "0 0 144 288"
*ImageableArea 100x150mm.Fullbleed/100mm x 150mm: "0 0 283 425"

*DefaultPaperDimension: 4x6.Fullbleed
*PaperDimension 4x6.Fullbleed/4.00x6.00" (shipping label): "288 432"
*PaperDimension 4x8.Fullbleed/4.00x8.00": "288 576"
*PaperDimension 4x4.Fullbleed/4.00x4.00": "288 288"
*PaperDimension 3x5.Fullbleed/3.00x5.00": "216 360"
*PaperDimension 2.25x4.Fullbleed/2.25x4.00": "162 288"
*PaperDimension 2x4.Fullbleed/2.00x4.00": "144 288"
*PaperDimension 100x150mm.Fullbleed/100mm x 150mm: "283 425"

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsRowCount 8/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0/cupsColorSpace 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *Darkness/Darkness: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: 6
*Darkness 0/0: ""
*Darkness 1/1: ""
*Darkness 2/2: ""
*Darkness 3/3: ""
*Darkness 4/4: ""
*Darkness 5/5: ""
*Darkness 6/6: ""
