*OpenUI *zeMediaTracking/Media Tracking: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *zeMediaTracking
*DefaultzeMediaTracking: Gap
*zeMediaTracking Gap/Gap-separated labels: ""
*zeMediaTracking Continuous/Continuous stock: ""
*CloseUI: *zeMediaTracking

*OpenUI *AdjustHorizontal/Horizontal Offset (dots): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *AdjustHorizontal
*DefaultAdjustHorizontal: 0
*AdjustHorizontal -24/-24: ""
*AdjustHorizontal -20/-20: ""
*AdjustHorizontal -16/-16: ""
*AdjustHorizontal -12/-12: ""
*AdjustHorizontal -8/-8: ""
*AdjustHorizontal -4/-4: ""
*AdjustHorizontal 0/0: ""
*AdjustHorizontal 4/4: ""
*AdjustHorizontal 8/8: ""
*AdjustHorizontal 12/12: ""
*AdjustHorizontal 16/16: ""
*AdjustHorizontal 20/20: ""
*AdjustHorizontal 24/24: ""
*CloseUI: *AdjustHorizontal

*OpenUI *AdjustVertical/Vertical Offset (dots): PickOne
*OrderDependency: 40 AnySetup *AdjustVertical
*DefaultAdjustVertical: 0
*AdjustVertical -24/-24: ""
*AdjustVertical -20/-20: ""
*AdjustVertical -16/-16: ""
*AdjustVertical -12/-12: ""
*AdjustVertical -8/-8: ""
*AdjustVertical -4/-4: ""
*AdjustVertical 0/0: ""
*AdjustVertical 4/4: ""
*AdjustVertical 8/8: ""
*AdjustVertical 12/12: ""
*AdjustVertical 16/16: ""
*AdjustVertical 20/20: ""
*AdjustVertical 24/24: ""
*CloseUI: *AdjustVertical

*CloseGroup: General/General

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM

*% End of LabelPrinter.ppd
